          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Ladybird Xios Launcher** installs a freedesktop `.desktop` entry for the standalone Ladybird browser.\n\nIt lets iosc, GNOME, KDE, and Xios launcher tooling list Ladybird alongside desktop apps. Launching it foregrounds the installed `com.max.ladybird` UIKit app through `uiopen`; it is a launcher bridge, not a Wayland embed of the browser window."
